  "details": "Included with the Avatar Creator Economy, there should be a website similar to gumroad/payhip for Avatars that are officially endorsed by VRChat. This would give people a centralized place to look for avatars that is lower budget/investment than an entirely in app Avatar Creator Economy. \n\nWe know the Creator Economy is a big goal for VRChat to start to make a percent on Avatar sales, which is a good idea. The urge to make an in app version of it is a good idea, but may make it more difficult due to actually having to put the headset on to search for new avatars. Using a website instead of purely in-app methods will allow for the downloading and editing of models using unitypackages. This could be paired with the in-app method to allow people to see the initial version of the avatar when then buy it, and then download the unitypackage later though the website. To avoid currency issues, VRChat Credits could be used instead of direct transactions.\n\nEdit: For 18+ avatars, just require the 18+ verification.",
